# Generated, and committed by accident until #147.
#
# Neither of these is read from the checkout: the published site is built
# fresh by `docs.yml` and pushed to `gh-pages` by `mike`, and the bytecode is
# whatever Python last happened to compile. Tracking them meant every test run
# and every docs build reported ~140 modified files that were not changes —
# so "the working tree is dirty" stopped carrying information, and a real
# uncommitted change had somewhere to hide.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# `mkdocs build` output.
/site/
